rmance of Our American Cousin in 1865.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad30-77ec-b608-1e45098b6a80","description":"John Wilkes Booth","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad30-7170-a873-0de4a8bf7ae9","description":"Lee Harvey Oswald","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad30-7567-9ac6-8c10ce37f3c6","description":"Mark David Chapman","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad30-7a3c-985d-50b418817aef","description":"Leon Czolgosz","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad30-7c2d-b72e-df27b787fb51","category":"01a21312-b489-7ebc-94f2-41649ebfcaca","question":"Which engineer designed the iron skeleton inside the Statue of Liberty?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Gustave Eiffel engineered the statue\u2019s internal support structure, while sculptor Fr\u00e9d\u00e9ric Auguste Bartholdi designed its exterior.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad30-7820-8703-afc21c85fe23","description":"Gustave Eiffel","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad30-75b4-a409-86d6bf7fd886","description":"Fr\u00e9d\u00e9ric Auguste Bartholdi","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad30-7722-955b-6111f354bc47","description":"Isambard Kingdom Brunel","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad30-78cd-9cf0-a320e07574b3","description":"Thomas Edison","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad30-7154-9155-6be72f63f766","category":"01a21312-b489-7ebc-94f2-41649ebfcaca","question":"What epoch questioned the absolute power of royal rulers?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"The Age of Enlightenment emphasized reason and individual rights. Thinkers such as Montesquieu criticized concentrated power and influenced later constitutional government.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad30-7234-b269-3d0acf21f7c6","description":"Age of Enlightenment","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad30-7067-954f-16c45ff4c8b7","description":"Bronze Age","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad30-73cf-9fed-cf89d3bd418b","description":"Dark Age","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad30-79da-a48a-2b448d77faf4","de