ans","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad31-7322-88a3-25ad6a5bec27","description":"Reims","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad31-7976-bec0-9e2150d1bf01","description":"Rouen","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad31-70ad-88e5-5face08788db","description":"Paris","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad31-739e-874b-082db8ca8128","category":"01a21312-b489-7ebc-94f2-41649ebfcaca","question":"Before becoming a politician, which US President was a Hollywood actor?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Ronald Reagan later served as president of the Screen Actors Guild before entering politics.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad31-76c9-8527-5ea9bc3af531","description":"Ronald Reagan","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad31-7d78-95b3-d88c4104781c","description":"John F. Kennedy","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad31-73cf-adf7-e9556545e6d6","description":"Abraham Lincoln","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad31-723e-af76-2fec886c61e3","description":"Barack Obama","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad31-7ade-9850-e293dd052854","category":"01a21312-b489-7ebc-94f2-41649ebfcaca","question":"In which year did the Cold War between the U.S. and Soviet Union begin?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"1947 is often used as the starting point because the Truman Doctrine formalized U.S. opposition to the spread of communism, though the Cold War developed over time.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad31-7724-b130-3c903117e992","description":"1947","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad31-7143-8cff-ae2c4aef6499","description":"1945","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad31-74bf-b235-bc8ddc1539f0","description":"1938","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad31-7452-80b2-265847886a8d","description":"1955","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad31-7d2f-8252-6fbd7094db89","category":"01a21312-b489-7ebc-94f2-41649ebfcaca","question":"Who was the last president of the Soviet Union?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Mikhail Gorbachev was the Soviet Union