lse}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad31-75cc-8723-d0a90497c9dd","category":"01a21312-b489-7ebc-94f2-41649ebfcaca","question":"Germany\'s allies in World War I were Austria-Hungary, Bulgaria and which other state?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"The Ottoman Empire joined the Central Powers in 1914 and fought Allied forces at Gallipoli and across the Middle East.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad31-71db-bfbd-16662487eceb","description":"The Ottoman Empire","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad31-7575-b6da-f69a2343df8c","description":"Italy","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad31-7f20-8a9f-b84915a4bcd0","description":"Russia","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad31-7980-9c78-9ec45ef32bc6","description":"Spain","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad31-78c0-a763-a96ecb2a087a","category":"01a21312-b489-7ebc-94f2-41649ebfcaca","question":"What war was the USA involved in between 1950 and 1953?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"The Korean War ended in an armistice in 1953, not a formal peace treaty, so the peninsula remains divided.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad31-7e20-b8cc-839156a9098d","description":"Korean War","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad31-7017-9ddb-60c783f875de","description":"Vietnam War","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad31-7a50-8d8e-b9281baa6ea7","description":"World War I","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad31-77f0-bc44-d95a299ef727","description":"World War II","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad31-786a-befa-e955b6aebf65","category":"01a21312-b489-7ebc-94f2-41649ebfcaca","question":"What was the nickname given to the possible computer bug that caused worldwide concern leading up to the year 2000?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Y2K concerns centered on whether software using two-digit years would treat \u201c00\u201d as 1900 instead of 2000, potentially disrupting computer systems.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad31-7c7e-a0eb-96e35444ee6d","description":"Y2K","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad31-7fb4-9a21-0a81aca79543","description":"Bug2000","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad31-7429-bdc6-e91befa4992e","description":"Trojan Horse","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad31-792d-9896-a9d14a1d083a","description":"The Millennial Worm","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad31-74a7-b13f-ace440cdb608","category":"01a21312-b489-7ebc-94f2-41649ebfcaca","question":"In which country was Adolf Hitler born?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Adolf Hitler was born in Braunau am Inn, Austria, in 1889, when the country was part of the Austro-Hungarian Empire.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad31-760e-ab35-3495b75d2216","description":"Austria","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad31-7973-88c9-da3098967856","description":"Germany","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad31-73b2-98a5-b09a15563298","description":"Belgium","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad31-7e7f-baa1-c79dbb5a9e13","description":"Switzerland","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad31-7f8d-b543-975786153efc","category":"01a21312-b489-7ebc-94f2-41649ebfcaca","question":"Which French king was married to Marie Antoinette?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Louis XVI was executed by guillotine in 1793; Marie Antoinette was executed later that year.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad31-79c9-bb2a-935310002f40","description":"Louis XVI","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad31-7df4-888d-b907f258861c","description":"Louis XIV","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad31-7f0a-97a9-7318eb9b5adf","description":"Louis XV","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad31-72c7-b404-0aea67e8cca5","description":"Henry IV","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad31-7e30-9d05-77cd3ae1e34d","category":"01a21312-b489-7ebc-94f2-41649ebfcaca","question":"The 15th century was characterized by a decline in which economic system?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Feudalism weakened in parts of Europe as commerce, towns, and stronger monarchies eroded local lords\u2019 power; the pace varied by region.","alternativ